{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/items/127660/", "pk": 127660, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/", "pk": 34948, "shortname": "hawaiinautical-kona", "name": "Hawaii Nautical Big Island", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Kona Luxury Dolphin Snorkel Sail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "Kona Luxury Dolphin Snorkel Sail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 9.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 4.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 10000, "description": "***Maximum of 6 guests aboard makes for an uncrowded, intimate experience aboard a spacious and luxurious yacht***\n\nPrice is per person up to 6 people.\n\nLunch included\n\n##Schedule\n\n4 hours\n\n**Morning** 9:00 AM -1PM\n\n##About\n\nLunch, dolphin viewing, whale-watching in-season\n\nHawaii Nautical takes you on an unparalleled yacht to experience the beauty and grandeur of the Kona coast and its most bejeweled underwater treasures at stunning snorkeling bays along  the historic Kona coast. Snorkel location will be chosen based on the day’s best conditions and with guest input, and can include such marvelous sites as Pawai Bay noted for its caves, arches, and swimthroughs; or Makalawena offshore of what is often referred to as the Big Island’s best beach, accessible only by boat, hiking or rugged 4x4.\n\nSee dolphins and turtles year round. During whale season (December-April) also see humpback whales. \n\nCabins for rest & rejuvenation and private changing areas, plus in-cabin restrooms and fresh-water showers for comfort and convenience. Buy or bring your snorkel and mask, or sanitized re-usable sets are available as a backup. Fins and snorkel vests are provided and in-water assistance from expert crew are included. \n\nEnjoy deli lunch al fresco.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Aloha!\n#IMPORTANT REQUIRED STEP:  Separately you will receive an email for the waiver to be done by each individual in your party participating in a Hawaii Nautical/Port Waikiki Cruises activity. Parents/guardians also submit a form for each person 17 and under. Answer all questions, review health and safety precautions, and sign the waiver acknowledgment within one day of your scheduled activity.\n\nReminder to bring a towel if planning to snorkel.  For safety, no spray sunscreen to be used on board and no full face masks may be used for snorkeling.\n\nThank you for booking with Hawaii Nautical.  We look forward to seeing you soon!  If you have any questions please feel free to call us at 808-234-7245.\n\nMahalo!\n\nHawaii Nautical", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 20, "headline": "4 Hours • Kona Coast Snorkel & Dolphin Cruise • Lunch Included", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiinautical-kona/items/127660/images/1586248/", "pk": 1586248, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ASLmt5epRsWW82ZIxfV7", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ASLmt5epRsWW82ZIxfV7", "company": {"cls": "Company"